            </p>
            <div
                class="flex gap-8 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-light/40"
            >
                <a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                    >Aviso Legal</a
                >
                <a href="#" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                    >Términos</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
